{{increase}} '''Promoted from [[2025–26 National First Division]]'''

* [[Kruger United F.C.|Kruger United]]<ref>{{Cite web |last=Rabothe |first=Tshepo |date=May 2, 2026 |title=Kruger United seal Betway Premiership automatic promotion |url=https://farpost.co.za/2026/05/02/kruger-united-seal-betway-premiership-automatic-promotion/ |access-date=2026-06-13 |website=FARPost |language=en-ZA}}</ref>
