{{decrease}} '''Relegated to [[2026–27 National First Division]]'''

* [[Orbit College F.C.|Orbit College]]<ref>{{Cite web |date=May 23, 2026 |title=Orbit relegated after one season in the PSL, Chiefs lose last match of the season |url=https://www.timeslive.co.za/sport/soccer/2026-05-23-orbit-relegated-after-one-season-in-the-psl-chiefs-lose-last-match-of-the-season/ |access-date=2026-06-13 |website=TimesLIVE |language=en}}</ref>
